{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>וטהר את הנגע.</b> For the affliction has already gone forth entirely to the outside and it has departed from him. And the sense of <b>וטהר את הנגע.</b> is by speech, that that affliction will not defile others."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:09:46.629341455Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}